{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The DEMO mainly offers a process experience of the first two chapters of &quot;Mysterious Island: Missing Amy&quot;, allowing you to get a sneak peek of Ada's journey to find her sister! Solve all kinds of puzzles by interacting with the items in the scene!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It seems that by clicking and rotating the fan blade to the appropriate position, one can get something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706610/extras/1.jpg?t=1746689107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The wind and waves at sea are getting stronger and stronger. Complete the task of unfurling the sails according to the instructions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706610/extras/2.jpg?t=1746689107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deck was also in a mess by the wind and waves. Help Amy tidy up. How can all the items be placed without overlapping?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706610/extras/3.jpg?t=1746689107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More puzzle-solving gameplay can be experienced in the demo version</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706610?t=1746689107","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706610?t=1746689107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706610/cb84f5606edda9392415b50549c0dabf43a0fc9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746689107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706610/cb84f5606edda9392415b50549c0dabf43a0fc9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746689107","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The DEMO mainly offers a process experience of the first two chapters of &quot;Mysterious Island: Missing Amy&quot;, allowing you to get a sneak peek of Ada's journey to find her sister! Solve all kinds of puzzles by interacting with the items in the scene!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It seems that by clicking and rotating the fan blade to the appropriate position, one can get something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706610/extras/1.jpg?t=1746689107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The wind and waves at sea are getting stronger and stronger. Complete the task of unfurling the sails according to the instructions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706610/extras/2.jpg?t=1746689107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deck was also in a mess by the wind and waves. Help Amy tidy up. How can all the items be placed without overlapping?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706610/extras/3.jpg?t=1746689107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More puzzle-solving gameplay can be experienced in the demo version</p>","developers":["TAPROMANCE"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3439040","name":"Mystery Island:Missing Amy"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706610/83320070d4b3a785948e77b4e5dc09d3d3d33e15/header.jpg?t=1746689107","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133158,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133158/movie480.mp4